  "prefLabel": "Mil 103.02 Custodian of Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mil 103.02 Custodian of Records. The department shall be the custodian of the board’s records and respond to requests to examine those portions of the board’s records which are subject to public inspection.\n\nSource. #7313, eff 7-1-00; ss by #12862-A, eff 2-29-19",
